### Task 생성 API
POST localhost:8080/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

{
  "title": "API 명세 작성",
  "content": "Task 생성 API 구현"

}


### Task 수정 API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6
Content-Type: application/json

### Tag 생성
POST localhost:8080/api/projects/1/tags
Content-Type: application/json
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

{
  "name": "sangbaek"
}

### 프로젝트 태그 목록 조회
GET localhost:8080/api/projects/1/tags
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

### Tag 수정
PATCH localhost:8080/api/tags/2
Content-Type: application/json
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

{
  "name": "sangbaek2"
}


### Tag 삭제 -> task_tags 구현 후 테스트
DELETE localhost:8080/api/tags/1
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

### Task에 Tag 연결 -> task_tags 구현 후 테스트
PUT localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/tags/1
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

### Task에서 Tag 제거 -> task_tags 구현 후 테스트
DELETE localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/tags/1
X-MEMBER-ID: 100

###